│                                                                                                                                                                                                      │
│  To solve this task, I will:                                                                                                                                                                         │
│                                                                                                                                                                                                      │
│  1. Retrieve the Spotify password from the Supervisor app.                                                                                                                                           │
│  2. Log in to Spotify to obtain an access token.                                                                                                                                                     │
│  3. Use the `show_playlist_library` API to find a playlist by Luna Starlight.                                                                                                                        │
│  4. Use the `show_playlist` API to get the songs in that playlist.                                                                                                                                   │
│  5. Use the `play_song` API to play the first song in the playlist.                                                                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                                                                                                                      │
│  Let's start by retrieving the Spotify password.                                                                                                                                                     │
│                                                                                                                                                                                                      │
│  ```python                                                                                                                                                                                           │
│  passwords = apis.supervisor.show_account_passwords()                                                                                                                                                │
│  spotify_password = [p["password"] for p in passwords if p["account_name"] == "spotify"][0]                                                                                                          │
│  print(spotify_password)                                                                                                                                                                             │
│  ```                                                                                                                                                                                                 │
│                                                                                                                                                                                                      │
